"     запити — найцінніші: саме з них видно, де саме виникла складність."
msgstr ""
"Every SQL query you run in your database: both successful and\n"
"     failed, along with the query text and execution time. Failed\n"
"     queries are the most valuable: they show exactly where the "
"difficulty was."

#: front/app/templates/help.html:77
